@startuml plan-run-states
title Figure 4.1 PlanExecutor run states (F12)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam dpi 130
[*] --> Running : execute(plan)
Running --> Running : advance() / step done
Running --> AwaitingApproval : advance() / checkpoint step reached
AwaitingApproval --> Running : approve(APPROVE)
AwaitingApproval --> Running : approve(CHANGE_STRATEGY) / re-run affected steps
AwaitingApproval --> Paused : approve(REJECT)
Running --> Paused : step failed after retries
Paused --> Running : resume()
Running --> Completed : advance() / last step done
Running --> Cancelled : cancel()
AwaitingApproval --> Cancelled : cancel()
Paused --> Cancelled : cancel()
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Cancelled : completed results kept,\nno partial exports
@enduml
